# Plan mode entered mid-session (Andre's report, 2026-10-15): start in
# manual, /plan, ask for a change. The plan must come up for approval,
# and approving must move the footer out of plan mode. Before the fix the
# model was told "Not in plan mode; no approval needed. Proceed directly."
# and went ahead while the footer still said "plan only".
@faux testdata/faux/qa/plan-midsession.yaml
@size 120x40

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
EXPECT /ask before edits/
TYPE /plan
KEY enter
WAITFOR /Enabled plan mode/ 20
EXPECT /plan only/
SEND make done.txt
WAITFOR /Ready to code\?/ 20
SHOT plan-approval
EXPECT /Yes, manually approve edits/
EXPECT /plan only/
KEY 2
WAITFOR /Allow kiln to write to done.txt\?/ 20
SHOT after-approval
# approved into manual: the footer left plan mode, and manual asks first
EXPECT /ask before edits/
EXPECT_NOT /plan only/
KEY 1
WAITFOR /Wrote it\./ 20
SHOT done
EXPECT_NOT /Not in plan mode/
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
